{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "when": {
        "source": {
          "kind": "stream",
          "event": "capabilities",
          "path": "connected"
        },
        "op": "eq",
        "value": false
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "title": "Not connected to a machine",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "title": "This module works through a machine you are connected to",
              "lines": [
                "It reaches the rest of your network from there: SSH to find machines and install the agent, then HTTP to everything the agent runs.",
                "Connect to a machine on the same network as the fleet - the machine list is in the sidebar - and this page fills in by itself."
              ],
              "tone": "info"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "source": {
              "kind": "stream",
              "event": "capabilities",
              "path": "problem"
            },
            "op": "exists"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "section",
              "title": "This machine cannot reach the fleet",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "keyValue",
                  "source": {
                    "kind": "stream",
                    "event": "capabilities"
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "key": "sshVersion",
                      "label": "SSH client"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "problem",
                      "label": "Problem"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "What to do",
                  "lines": [
                    "Something the module cannot work without is missing on the machine you are connected to, so nothing has been read and no figure below would be real.",
                    "Module settings lists every tool it looks for. Install the missing ones there, or connect to a machine that already has them."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                },
                {
                  "type": "actions",
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "label": "Check again",
                      "method": "sweepNow"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "when": {
                "source": {
                  "kind": "stream",
                  "event": "capabilities",
                  "path": "warning"
                },
                "op": "exists"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "Working, with something worth knowing",
                  "lines": [
                    "The fleet is being read, and one thing about the machine you are connected to makes it slower or less precise than it could be. Module settings names it."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "subnav",
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "running",
                  "label": "Running",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "conditional",
                      "when": {
                        "source": {
                          "kind": "stream",
                          "event": "ui",
                          "path": "hintsOn"
                        },
                        "op": "eq",
                        "value": true
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "What a job is",
                          "lines": [
                            "Anything that touches several machines at once: installing the agent, deploying a service, acting on ticked rows. Each has one line per machine, so a run where two of twenty failed says which two.",
                            "Cancelling stops the machines not yet reached. It does not undo the ones already done - a half-installed agent is worse than a slightly late stop."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Jobs",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "statusCards",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "invoke",
                            "method": "jobRows",
                            "intervalKey": "service-fleet"
                          },
                          "rowKey": "id",
                          "titleKey": "label",
                          "statusKey": "health",
                          "subtitleKey": "progressLabel",
                          "items": {
                            "key": "chips",
                            "labelKey": "label",
                            "statusKey": "status",
                            "pinnedKey": "pinned",
                            "visibleRows": 2,
                            "pinnedFilterLabel": "Only failures",
                            "emptyText": "no results yet"
                          },
                          "columns": {
                            "default": 2,
                            "min": 1,
                            "max": 4
                          },
                          "rowActions": [
                            {
                              "label": "Cancel",
                              "method": "jobCancel",
                              "argsFromRow": [
                                "id"
                              ],
                              "confirm": "Cancel this job? Machines it has already reached are not undone.",
                              "kind": "danger"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowDetail": [
                            {
                              "type": "section",
                              "title": "What happened on each machine",
                              "blocks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "table",
                                  "source": {
                                    "kind": "invoke",
                                    "method": "jobItems",
                                    "args": [
                                      "$row.id"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "columns": [
                                    {
                                      "key": "name",
                                      "label": "Machine"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "status",
                                      "label": "Result"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "message",
                                      "label": "Detail"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "ms",
                                      "label": "Took",
                                      "format": "duration",
                                      "align": "right"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "rowKey": "name",
                                  "emptyText": "This job kept no per-machine detail."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ],
                          "emptyText": "No jobs yet. Installing an agent or deploying a service starts one."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "finished",
                  "label": "History",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "History",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "table",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "invoke",
                            "method": "jobRows",
                            "intervalKey": "service-fleet"
                          },
                          "columns": [
                            {
                              "key": "label",
                              "label": "Job"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "stateBadges",
                              "label": "Result",
                              "format": "badges",
                              "sortable": false
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "state",
                              "label": "State"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "kind",
                              "label": "Kind"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "done",
                              "label": "Done",
                              "align": "right"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "failed",
                              "label": "Failed",
                              "align": "right"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "total",
                              "label": "Machines",
                              "align": "right"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "startedAt",
                              "label": "Started",
                              "format": "time"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "tookLabel",
                              "label": "Took"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowKey": "id",
                          "sortDefault": {
                            "key": "startedAt",
                            "dir": "desc"
                          },
                          "filterKeys": [
                            "label",
                            "state",
                            "kind"
                          ],
                          "groupModes": [
                            {
                              "id": "state",
                              "label": "By result",
                              "key": "state"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowDetail": [
                            {
                              "type": "section",
                              "title": "Per machine",
                              "blocks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "table",
                                  "source": {
                                    "kind": "invoke",
                                    "method": "jobItems",
                                    "args": [
                                      "$row.id"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "columns": [
                                    {
                                      "key": "name",
                                      "label": "Machine"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "status",
                                      "label": "Result"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "message",
                                      "label": "Detail"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "rowKey": "name",
                                  "emptyText": "No detail was kept for this job."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ],
                          "emptyText": "No jobs have run yet."
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "actions",
                          "actions": [
                            {
                              "label": "Clear finished",
                              "method": "jobsClear",
                              "confirm": "Remove the finished jobs from this list?"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
